sequenceDiagram
 participant Web as Browser client
 participant API as Order service API
 participant DB as Persistent database
 Web->>API: Query order details and current payment status
 API->>API: Validate identity and order access
 API->>DB: Cache miss: read order records
 DB-->>API: Return order records and payment status
 API-->>Web: Return results and update the page

 activate API
 alt Cache hit
 API-->>Web: Return cached result
 else Cache miss
 loop Retry failed query
 API->>DB: Read records
 DB-->>API: Return result
 end
 end
 API-)Web: Async update notification
 deactivate API
